    "apparatus": "Use existing public Strike with the current stamp and next acknowledged sequence. Check accepted zero-native boundary and exact f32 anatomical pose/velocity words; require a real positive-impulse contact and full 800 Hz observation coverage. No impact within 5 seconds is a failure.",
