    "resistedResponse": "Require no new fall/recovery/source/forecast throughout the response and unchanged terminal binding. At a normal control boundary after at least 20,020 native samples from contact, require Upright, pending epoch cleared, last 800 original predicates/counters, exact unchanged f32 current anchors across those 800 samples and the actual current-anchor diagnostic. Both last 800 integral and cumulative loaded-foot tangent integral from the beginning of this whole response must be\u226420mm. The cumulative integral never resets inside a resisted response.",
